{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03935","headline":"汾阴后土祠作 · 李适","name":"汾阴后土祠作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔予读旧史，遍覩汉世君。\n武皇实稽古，建兹百代勳。\n号令垂懋典，旧经备阙文。\n西巡历九嶷，舳舻被江滨。\n勒兵十八万，旌旗何纷纷。\n朅来茂陵下，英声不复闻。\n我行岁方晏，极望山河分。\n神光终冥漠，鼎气独氛氲。\n揽涕步脽上，登高见彼汾。\n雄图今安在，飞飞有白云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}